# Cistern Hall's old cisterns (CIPlay cistern_hall_caves, 11-11; any world). Points as in its recipe (the origin frame):
# two mouths at hill 1's west foot, 39 -47 and 39 -40 (a shoulder raised on the hill holds them), the passage east from
# the first to the bend at 54 -42 and the third room past it to 58 -42; the second room off the passage at 46..47.6
# -48..-53 with the cistern keeper's chest at 48.2 -54.3 past its end; the second mouth's passage in along z -40. Dry, no
# air zone. In by the first mouth, chest, bend room, out by the second.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

# Outside: both mouths in the shoulder's foot
picture ch_cave_out 28 6 -44 40 4 -44
walk 33 -47 to 39 -47 to 46 -47 to 46.5 -49 to 47.6 -52.8
picture ch_cave_room 46 6.5 -47 48.2 5.5 -54.3 light=20
open Cistern keeper's chest
wait 2
expect item Bolt 3
# On to the bend and the third room under the summit
walk 47.6 -52.8 to 46.5 -49 to 46 -47 to 54 -47 to 54 -42 to 57 -42
picture ch_cave_bend 51 4 -46 57 3.5 -42 light=20
# Out by the second mouth
walk 57 -42 to 54 -42 to 50 -40 to 39 -40 to 33 -40
picture ch_cave_out2 33 5 -36 39 4 -40
